      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "type": "heatmap",
      "title": "Frame time distribution",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 26,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 8
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "sum by (le) (increase(gmod_server_frame_duration_seconds_bucket{job=\"$job\", instance=\"$instance\"}[$__interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{le}}",
          "range": true,
          "instant": false,
          "refId": "A",
          "format": "heatmap",
          "interval": "1m"
        }
      ],
      "description": "Server frames per minute in each frame-time bucket. Each cell is a bucket; brighter means more frames.\n\nBy default the buckets follow the tick length: the first one, up to about 1.16 ticks, holds normal frames, the next ones slow frames, and the last ones freezes of 1 to 5 seconds and more. otel_metrics_frame_buckets sets them by hand.",
      "interval": "1m",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": {
            "hideFrom": {
              "legend": false,
              "tooltip": false,
              "viz": false
            },
            "scaleDistribution": {
              "type": "linear"
            }
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "calculate": false,
        "yAxis": {
          "axisPlacement": "left",
          "unit": "s",
          "reverse": false
        },
        "rowsFrame": {
          "layout": "auto"
        },
        "color": {
          "mode": "scheme",
          "scheme": "Oranges",
          "scale": "exponential",
          "exponent": 0.5,
          "fill": "dark-orange",
          "steps": 64,
          "reverse": false
        },
        "cellGap": 1,
        "filterValues": {
          "le": 1e-09
        },
        "showValue": "never",
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "single",
          "yHistogram": false,
          "showColorScale": false
        },
        "legend": {
          "show": true
        },
        "exemplars": {
          "color": "rgba(255,0,255,0.7)"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Physics",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 34,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 1
      },
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Physics per tick",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 35,
        "w": 4,
        "h": 8
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.5, sum by (le) (rate(gmod_physics_step_duration_seconds_bucket{job=\"$job\", instance=\"$instance\"}[$__rate_interval]))) / max (gmod_server_tick_interval_seconds{job=\"$job\", instance=\"$instance\"})",
          "legendFormat": "__auto",
          "range": false,
          "instant": true,
          "refId": "A",
          "interval": "$export_interval"
        }
      ],
      "description": "Median physics step as a share of one tick.\n\n- **Below 50%**: physics leaves plenty of room for the rest of the game.\n- **Above 100%**: physics alone doesn't fit into a tick, so the server falls behind and the game slows down.\n\nPhysics cost grows with props that move or touch each other. Frozen and resting props cost almost nothing. Freeze or remove props, or lower the tick rate: physics runs every tick, so 66 tick costs twice as much as 33.",
      "interval": "$export_interval",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percentunit",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "orange",
                "value": 0.5
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 1
              }
            ]
          },
          "mappings": [],
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "decimals": 0
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "textMode": "auto",
        "orientation": "auto",
        "wideLayout": true,
        "showPercentChange": false
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 11,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Physics step",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 4,
        "y": 35,
        "w": 20,
        "h": 8
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.5, sum by (le) (rate(gmod_physics_step_duration_seconds_bucket{job=\"$job\", instance=\"$instance\"}[$__rate_interval])))",
          "legendFormat": "median",
